      <p style="font-family:'Lora',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.08rem;color:rgba(220,215,201,0.82);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:640px;text-align:left;">Most relationships do not end in dramatic explosions. They erode quietly, through patterns of communication that seem ordinary in the moment but accumulate into something that slowly hollows out the connection between two people.</p>
